#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 苗木君…あなたは怖い？
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you scared, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. この場所に閉じ込められて…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Being trapped in a place like this..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなの…当たり前だよ…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-Who wouldn't be...?"
msgstr ""

#. 怖いに決まってるよ。
#. こんな訳のわからない場所に閉じ込められてさ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Of course I'm scared, being trapped in this insane\n"
"school..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…良かったわね。
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Ah. That's good."
msgstr ""

#. 良かったって…何が？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's...good?"
msgstr ""

#. 怖いと思うのは、
#. 想像力が働いている証拠…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Fear is proof that your imagination is functioning."
msgstr ""

#. それは、怖さを感じてないより、
#. よっぽど、いい状態よ。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Frankly, I feel bad for anyone who can't feel fear."
msgstr ""

#. 想像力が働かなければ、
#. どんな行動に走るか、わかったもんじゃない…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Without imagination, you can never deduce which action\n"
"to take next."
msgstr ""

#. でも、そう言う霧切さんは、
#. まったく怖くなさそうだけど…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But what about you? You seem totally calm. You don't\n"
"act afraid at all."
msgstr ""

#. 私だって怖いわよ…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm scared too, of course..."
msgstr ""

#. ただ、それを知られないようにしているだけ。
#. 他人に知られても得なんてないから…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I simply hide my emotions. There's no advantage to be\n"
"gained from letting others see how you feel."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>隠してる<CLT>…って事？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You <CLT 3>hide<CLT>...? Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. …バカ正直なあなたと違ってね。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What I mean is, I'm not as foolishly open as you are."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>バカ正直って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Foolishly open...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、私が感じている“怖さ”は、
#. あなた達が感じているのとは少し違うかも…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Also, the \"fear\" I experience is a little different\n"
"from yours, I imagine."
msgstr ""

#. え？　どういう意味…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. あなた達が感じているのは“失う事”に対する怖さ。
#. だけど、私が感じているのは…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You're afraid of what you might lose, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“失ってしまった事”<CLT>に対する怖さ。
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But I'm afraid of what <CLT 3>I've already lost<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 意味…がわからないんだけど…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm sorry...I don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. …そうでしょうね。
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女はボクの疑問に返答すらせず、
#. 静かに背を向けると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She didn't bother answering any further. She just\n"
"turned, and...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあね。
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、そのまま歩き去ってしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that, she was gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まだ会話が途中って言うか…
#. むしろ会話らしい会話が始まってすらないのに…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, we're still just getting to know each other.\n"
"Maybe we'll talk more next time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…本当に謎だらけな人だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I understand her at all yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>霧切響子の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Kyoko's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと別れた後、
#. ボクはいったん、自分の部屋に戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
